---
source: tests/snapshots.rs
expression: picker.screen()
---
j/k ↓/↑  move                                               
1-9      focus row directly                                 
gg / G   first / last                                       
/        filter, Esc clears                                 
Enter    focus pane                                         
n        new Claude pane                                    
x        kill pane, asks y/n                                
p        toggle preview                                     
q / Esc  close                                              
?        toggle this help                                   
                                                            
tmux-agents v0.4.0                   press ? for keybindings
